  "name": "Jira: Create Release Tickets after Sprint Start",
  "state": "ENABLED",
  "description": "CER-7537: Sends release-generation requests to Worker 875 after the CER sprint starts. Worker 875 creates the matching versions and release tickets, prevents duplicates, and sends the outcome notifications.\n\n- For CeromaCore and Ceroma manual the release version is determined from the sprint number (X.XX -> X.XX.0).\n- For Mediator and PostIdentService the release version is determined from the sprint goal. The versions have to be included in the sprint goal in this pattern:\n<actual description of the goal>\nMediator <version>\nPostIdentService <version>\ne.g.\neArchiv\nMediator 1.33.0\nPostIdentService 2.11.0",
  "canOtherRuleTrigger": false,
  "notifyOnError": "FIRSTERROR",
  "authorAccountId": "JIRAUSER15085",
  "actorAccountId": "JIRAUSER23851",
  "created": 1768396012880,
